                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Should we hire specialist skincare SEO agency or generic e-com?</h3>
                                        <p>Specialist by year 2. Specialist costs 2-3x but delivers 4-8x organic revenue over 24-36 months. Generic e-com with category-agnostic templates fails skincare's 6-dimension keyword architecture + certification content + specialised schema needs.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the difference between specialist + generic content approach?</h3>
                                        <p>Specialist: 6-dimension silo + long-tail commercial-intent + certification + comparison depth + AI Overviews + regional-language + real category fluency. Generic: category-only silos + head-term targeting + listicles + English-only + vanity ranking metrics.</p>
                                        <h3>How many silo pages does skincare SEO need?</h3>
                                        <p>40-80 silo pages across concern + ingredient + product + skin-type + routine + budget dimensions. Built over 12-18 months. Each with unique content + internal linking + schema.</p>
                                        <h3>What schema for skincare SEO?</h3>
                                        <p>Product + Organization + LocalBusiness (per showroom if applicable) + BreadcrumbList + FAQPage + Article (blogs) + Review + AggregateRating. JSON-LD sitewide. 15-30% impression uplift within 45 days + unlocks AI Overviews eligibility.</p>
