                                        <p>Answer-first paragraphs (40-80 word direct answers) + structured lists + semantic headings + entity clarity + verifiable specifics + llms.txt file. 25-60% additional traffic layer possible within 6-12 months.</p>
                                        <h3>What is a realistic skincare SEO retainer?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 1-3 lakh / month specialist. Rs 40K-1.5 lakh generic. Specialist justified for brands targeting Rs 30L+ / month revenue where organic SEO compounds into 20-40% by month 24.</p>
