                                        <p>Yes at Rs 20 Cr+ / month revenue when in-house team is 4-6 specialists. Below scale, specialist agency delivers better cost + expertise. Hybrid (in-house senior + specialist agency execution) from Rs 5-20 Cr revenue.</p>
